  "text": "On the authority of Abu Abdullah Jabbir, the son of Abdullah al Ansari, may Allah be pleased of them both, a man asked the messenger of Allah, made the blessings and peace of Allah be upon him. Do you think that if I perform the obligatory prayers, fast in Ramadan, treat as lawful, that which is lawful, and treat as forbidden, that which is forbidden, and do nothing further. I shall enter Paradise, he said yes, and resulated by Muslim.",
